.DS_Store
.vscode
skeleton.md
tmp/
acceptance-tests/runs/
acceptance-tests/acceptance-tests.lock
# acceptance-tests/cache/ was tracked until 2026-08-04 so a fresh clone would
# inherit verdicts. Measured: `acceptance-tests --cache-check` scored 0 hits and
# 313 misses over the 307 committed entries. The key hashes the whole runner
# (`scripts/acceptance-tests/lib/**`) and the IDE's `--version`, so ONE harness
# commit — 202a7bb3, 2026-07-28 — invalidated every entry recorded up to
# 2026-07-05. The cache still pays off locally between edits; it just cannot
# survive the trip through git (FR-ACCEPT-CACHE).
acceptance-tests/cache/
framework/*/skills/*/acceptance-tests/runs/
framework/*/commands/*/acceptance-tests/runs/
framework/*/agents/*/acceptance-tests/runs/
.env
__pycache__/
_research_tmp/

