# Generated composite/atom SKILL.md (FR-SKILL-COMPOSE).
# Source of truth: framework/atoms/*.md + framework/composites/*.md + framework/composites.yaml.
# Every consumer regenerates via `deno run -A scripts/generate-skill-composites.ts --write`
# before reading. Keep this list in lock-step with `--list-targets` output;
# scripts/check-skills.ts enforces parity.
framework/core/commands/commit/SKILL.md
framework/core/commands/push/SKILL.md
framework/core/commands/reflect-gate/SKILL.md
framework/core/commands/review-and-commit/SKILL.md
framework/core/commands/ship/SKILL.md
framework/core/commands/ship-task/SKILL.md
framework/core/skills/implement/SKILL.md
framework/core/skills/plan/SKILL.md
framework/core/skills/review/SKILL.md

