# SWE-bench Verified benchmark (FR-BENCH-SWE): Python venv + swebench run artifacts
.venv-swebench/
logs/
scripts/benchmark/runs/
*.smoke.json
*.bench-*.json
gold.*.json
benchmark-*.log
# swebench drops a <model_name_or_path>.<run-id>.json summary into the working
# directory on every grading pass, and the arm names are our model names; the
# real record is the cell. A narrower pair (baseline.pool2-*, flowai.pool2-*)
# used to sit further down and missed every other run id — which is how
# baseline.ab-baseline.json, 550 lines, rode into the repo root with an early
# commit and sat there unread until 2026-08-03. Root-anchored, so a
# legitimately tracked flowai.*.json somewhere below is still committed.
/baseline.*.json
/flowai.*.json

# FoxCode local profile/state (dev-only, not tracked)
.foxcode/

